 8 |  * to prove (or disprove) the complete login->payment->confirmation->
 9 |  * task_complete workflow, against whichever backend is currently running
10 |  * (real Groq, or LLM_PROVIDER=deterministic_test) — same real extension,
11 |  * same real Dev 1-5 code, no mocks.
